hap/doc -- documentation target for the Hap library
====================================================

Reserved as the per-library documentation directory. Intended uses:

  - Doxygen output for the Hap library (output directory set to this
    folder by the per-lib Doxyfile once the per-lib Doxygen integration
    lands -- see the deferred "Doxygen aufräumen" task).
  - Manuals, design notes and protocol descriptions specific to the
    Hap library: random-number factory, GRandomT generators, CUDA-based
    RNG (USECUDARNG), random distribution wrappers, etc.

Today this folder is a placeholder so the layout is uniform across all
four libraries (every <lib>/ now has benchmarks/, doc/, examples/,
include/, src/, tests/). Full Doxygen-per-library integration is a
follow-up step and intentionally not part of the 2026-05-28 layout
reorganisation.
